+#### [TorchIO](https://github.com/TorchIO-project/torchio)
+> **Description:** TorchIO is a medical-imaging processing library for PyTorch applications, focused on loading, preprocessing, augmentation, patch sampling, and writing 3D images efficiently. Unlike a model zoo, it solves repetitive engineering problems around MRI and 3D imaging pipelines, including domain-specific artifacts and augmentation steps that matter in real medical data. It is widely useful as infrastructure underneath custom segmentation, classification, and self-supervised workflows. GitHub metadata: last commit date Nov 18, 2025, 2,319 stars, primary language Python, license Apache-2.0.
+
