+#### [nnInteractive](https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/nnInteractive)
+> **Description:** nnInteractive is a 3D interactive segmentation framework trained across a large set of diverse 3D datasets and designed around promptable interactions such as points, scribbles, boxes, and lasso input. That focus makes it more user-in-the-loop than pure batch segmentation libraries. For teams exploring clinician-guided workflows, annotation acceleration, or adaptive segmentation UX in radiology, it is one of the more interesting open repositories to track. GitHub metadata: last commit date Mar 6, 2026, 374 stars, primary language Python, license Apache-2.0.
+
