+#### [CLAM](https://github.com/mahmoodlab/CLAM)
+> **Description:** CLAM is one of the best-known open computational pathology repositories for weakly supervised whole-slide classification. The project focuses on clustering-constrained attention multiple-instance learning, heatmap generation, feature extraction, and slide-level modeling without requiring patch-level annotations. It is especially useful for classification and subtyping tasks on WSIs where labels exist only at the slide or patient level. GitHub metadata: last visible GitHub page crawl last month, 1.6k stars, primary language Python, license GPL-3.0.
+
