+#### [MONAILabel](https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAILabel)
+> **Description:** MONAI Label focuses on assisted annotation for medical imaging, using interactive AI loops to reduce manual labeling time while continuously improving models as new labels arrive. The GitHub documentation highlights integrations with tools such as 3D Slicer, OHIF, QuPath, and custom viewers, making it practical for teams building annotation operations around radiology and pathology data. It is especially useful when model-assisted labeling speed matters more than building annotation logic from scratch. GitHub metadata: last commit date Jan 5, 2026, 802 stars, primary language Python, license Apache-2.0.
