+#### [medspacy](https://github.com/medspacy/medspacy)
+> **Description:** medspacy is a clinical NLP toolkit built on spaCy and designed for practical note processing tasks such as sentence segmentation, preprocessing, section detection, concept extraction utilities, and contextual assertion handling. It is modular by design, so teams can use the whole stack or only the pieces they need inside larger EHR pipelines. For many groups, it is the most straightforward open starting point for clinical text normalization and rule-assisted extraction. GitHub metadata: last commit date Aug 4, 2025, 616 stars, primary language Jupyter Notebook, license MIT.
