+> **Description:** MONAI Deploy App SDK is designed for turning imaging models into deployable clinical-style applications rather than stopping at notebooks. Its README centers on packaging, testing, verification, and workflow-oriented deployment for healthcare imaging, which is valuable for engineering teams moving from experimentation to operational inference. Compared with a raw training library, it provides more structure for interoperable app design and deployment readiness. GitHub metadata: last commit date Dec 16, 2025, 120 stars, primary language Jupyter Notebook, license Apache-2.0.
